# The build context is envs/airops: only what Dockerfile.occ3 copies goes in, so tests, fixtures, runs/, caches and the
# v1 and v2 packs stay out.
*
!core
!agentenv/pyproject.toml
!agentenv/airops_agentenv
!tasks/b6-v3
**/tests
**/.venv
**/*.egg-info
core/build
agentenv/build
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
